{
  "name": "intensive_decomposition",
  "description": "BD2 equipment decompose + enhance — ported from BD2-AUTO src/auto_tasks/Default/tasks/intensive_decomposition.py. Two phases: (1) decompose R-grade equipment, (2) enhance +10 selected equipment. Skeleton: open backpack → equipment → filter → R → confirm → one-click decompose → select pos → confirm → decompose → back_to_main → backpack → equipment → filter → 18+ → craft → confirm → select pos → refine → continuous refine → +10 → refine → skip → confirm → return. TODO: select_equipment_step, execute_enhancement_step, return_and_exit_step custom_steps simplified to linear sequences (Phase B). ROIs at 1920x1080 base resolution. (pending e2e verification — R37-P2 C2 PoC covers login only)",
